      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 25,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25334_p13_b5",
      "text": "Since each source dataset is already a well-curated spatial intelligence training dataset, we only\nperform the following lightweight pre-processing steps on each of them to obtain a unified instruction-\nfollowing format:\n",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        415.86,
        505.65,
        447.71
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        432,
        1663,
        2022,
        1790
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.06,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 220,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25334_p13_b6",
      "text": "Task mapping. We manually inspect the original category annotations of each source dataset. For\ndatasets without explicit category labels, we perform keyword-based matching according to the\ncharacteristics of the questions to assign a category. We then select samples belonging to our 13\ntarget task types from the categorized pool.\n",
      "bbox": [
        107.67,
        454.0,
        504.17,
        496.83
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        430,
        1815,
        2016,
        1987
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 10.03,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Medi",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 332,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25334_p13_b7",
      "text": "Format unification. All samples are converted into a consistent dictionary format consisting of the\nsystem-user dialogue (messages), the task type (type), and the associated images.\n",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        503.16,
        504.0,
        524.37
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
